<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Freddie Mac, Fannie Mae started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Freddie Mac, Fannie Mae started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said analyst Ken Posner initiated coverage of Federal Home Loan Mortgage Corp (Freddie Mac) and Fannie Mae with outperform ratings.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Freddie Mac was off 1/4 at 32-3/8 and Fannie Mae eased 3/8 to 43-1/4.</p>
</text>
